    "mission_2.synthesis": "The first AI response made assumptions about the frames and timestamps. The improved prompt makes these details clear. A wrong transform could make the robot think a person is in the wrong location. The rotated-coordinate test checks this. If TF is unavailable, the robot should not move.\n",
